## Article 1. Scope of the Law

```catala
declaration scope Article1Scope:
  input isPolicyRecommendation content YesNo
  input isExemptProceeding content YesNo
  output lawApplies content YesNo

scope Article1Scope:
  label default_applies definition lawApplies equals Yes
  
  label exempt_recommendation exception default_applies
  definition lawApplies under condition
    isPolicyRecommendation = Yes
    consequence equals No

  label exempt_proceeding exception default_applies
  definition lawApplies under condition
    isExemptProceeding = Yes
    consequence equals No
```
